ce of your sacred Evertree underground! Now, you and your tiny kin must dig into the earth to recover them in this incremental adventure! Discover rare artifacts to attract more kin to your cause and upgrade your Evertree as you mine into the depths!","steam_appid":3505770,"support_info":{"email":"thefoxknocks@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}